SUMMARY:Deadline: Omidyar Network: Tech Journalism Fund
DESCRIPTION:The Omidyar Network Tech Journalism Fund offers rolling grants 
 of $5\,000-$25\,000 for technology journalism projects. Relevant for journ
 alists and media organizations investigating AI\, tech policy\, and AI's i
 mpacts on culture\, society\, and creative industries.\n\nOrganisation: Om
 idyar Network\nLocation: Open to journalists and media organizations world
 wide.\nAward: $5\,000-$25\,000 per project. Rolling deadline through Decem
 ber 31\, 2026. No application fee.\nDuration: Per-project\; scope and time
 line defined in the proposal.\n\nMore: https://omidyar.com/tech-journalism
 -fund-application/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referr
 al
URL:https://omidyar.com/tech-journalism-fund-application/?utm_source=artifi
 cialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Open to journalists and media organizations worldwide.
END:VEVENT
