 enter\nLocation: New York City\, USA (in residence at the CUNY Graduate Ce
 nter\, September to May)\nAward: $72\,000 stipend plus writing space\, ful
 l research facilities and research assistance\nDuration: September 2027 to
  May 2028 (academic year in residence)\n\nMore: https://theleonlevycenterf
