  Reynolds Journalism Institute in Columbia\, Missouri\, United States.\nAw
 ard: USD 75\,000 for the Individual and Institutional tracks\, USD 100\,00
 0 for the Emerging Technology track\, paid in three instalments tied to de
 liverables\; RJI also pays for the fellow's visits to its Columbia\, Misso
 uri campus. No application fee.\nDuration: Eight months from 28 June 2027.
 \n\nMore: https://rjionline.org/about-rji-fellowships/?utm_source=artifici
 alnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
